WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.903
Brad: But the door was right there!

2
00:00:13.904 --> 00:00:16.338
Tina: I know where it was.

3
00:00:16.339 --> 00:00:19.381
Danny: How is that possible?

4
00:00:19.382 --> 00:00:21.883
Brad: We’re doomed!

5
00:00:21.884 --> 00:00:24.515
Tina: Now, let’s not get scared.

6
00:00:24.516 --> 00:00:26.082
Danny: Why not?

7
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:30.538
Tina: Because if there’s a way in, there’s got to be a way out.

8
00:00:30.539 --> 00:00:34.284
Brad: Let me ask my computer!

9
00:00:34.285 --> 00:00:36.014
Danny: Well?

10
00:00:36.015 --> 00:00:39.494
Brad: I asked it, “What’s the best way to get out?”

11
00:00:39.495 --> 00:00:42.250
Danny: And what did it say?

12
00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:46.196
Brad: It said, “Find an exit.”

13
00:00:46.197 --> 00:00:49.023
Danny: That computer is useless!

14
00:00:49.024 --> 00:00:51.003
Tina: Danny, calm down.

15
00:00:51.004 --> 00:00:54.499
Brad: She’s right. Getting upset won’t help.

16
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:59.609
Danny: Well, being calm isn’t helping.

17
00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:02.316
Tina: It’s as if we’re in the woods.

18
00:01:02.317 --> 00:01:06.511
Brad: Lost in the woods, that’s us.

19
00:01:06.512 --> 00:01:08.823
Danny: I can make a compass!

20
00:01:08.824 --> 00:01:10.339
Tina: What?

21
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.392
Danny: A compass! We find out which direction to go with a compass.

22
00:01:17.393 --> 00:01:20.141
Danny: There, that way is north.

23
00:01:20.142 --> 00:01:22.886
Brad: What good does that do?

24
00:01:22.887 --> 00:01:24.813
Danny: Well . . .

25
00:01:24.814 --> 00:01:29.987
Tina: If we keep walking in one direction, I’m sure we’ll find something.

26
00:01:29.988 --> 00:01:35.033
Danny: She’s right. Standing here won’t help.

27
00:01:35.034 --> 00:01:38.178
Brad: Something feels funny.

28
00:01:38.179 --> 00:01:44.200
Danny: Yeah, the ground is all squishy.

29
00:01:44.201 --> 00:01:47.035
Tina: My shoes are getting wet.

30
00:01:47.036 --> 00:01:50.410
Brad: Yeah. Mine too.

31
00:01:50.411 --> 00:01:54.607
Tina: The ground is getting squishier!

32
00:01:54.608 --> 00:01:58.570
Brad: Our feet are sinking in.

33
00:01:58.571 --> 00:02:02.936
Danny: Whoa!

34
00:02:02.937 --> 00:02:09.383
Brad: You must have stepped on a geyser!

35
00:02:09.384 --> 00:02:11.393
Tina: Look at that!

36
00:02:11.394 --> 00:02:16.297
Danny: Our footsteps are making puddles.

37
00:02:16.298 --> 00:02:19.985
Brad: This isn’t good!

38
00:02:19.986 --> 00:02:23.338
Tina: Let’s start running!

39
00:02:23.339 --> 00:02:27.516
Danny: I can’t get my feet out!

40
00:02:27.517 --> 00:02:29.700
Brad: This is really bad!

41
00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:33.956
Tina: I wish I were a giant so I could just leap out of this.

42
00:02:33.957 --> 00:02:41.242
Brad: If you were a giant, you’d just sink faster.

43
00:02:41.243 --> 00:02:46.722
Danny: What are we going to do?
